rischer Zofingerverein\">Schweizerischer Zofingerverein</a>,  Corporationenconvent St. Gallen</td>\n<td>nichtschlagend</td>\n<td>Männer</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AV Steinacher<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td>\n<td>1953</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"centered\" style=\"width:60px; border: 1px solid; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:silver; height:1px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:pink; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:white; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:green; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:silver; height:1px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>rosa-weiss-grün\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Datei:Wappen_Steinacher.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Wappen_Steinacher.jpg/120px-Wappen_Steinacher.jpg?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Wappen_Steinacher.jpg/250px-Wappen_Steinacher.jpg?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"453\" data-file-height=\"469\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Datei:Steinacherzirkel.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Steinacherzirkel.gif/60px-Steinacherzirkel.gif?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"59\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//